#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "56_Nishihama"
msgid "This is where the kidnapper said to go. He said to give the\\r\nmoney to－"
msgstr "Aquí es donde el secuestrador dijo que debía ir.\nMe dijo que le entregara el dinero a—"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "68_Taxi Driver"
msgid "Excuse me... Are you Nishihama-san?"
msgstr "Disculpe... ¿Es usted el señor Nishihama-san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "80_Nishihama"
msgid "Erm... Yes. That's me."
msgstr "Ah... Sí. Yo soy Nishihama, pero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "92_Taxi Driver"
msgid "Yes, well, I was told to deliver a briefcase..."
msgstr "Me indicaron que debía entregar un maletín..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "104_Nishihama"
msgid "Oh, yes, of course! This is the one..."
msgstr "Oh, claro. Aquí tiene."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "116_Taxi Driver"
msgid "Gotta say, I don't usually do this kind of thing. I'm not a\\r\ndelivery man, you know."
msgstr "Debo admitir que no suelo hacer este tipo de cosas. No soy\\r\nrepartidor, ¿sabe?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "Pardon me, friend, but... Do you know where you're taking\\r\nthat?"
msgstr "Oye, amigo. De casualidad, ¿podemos saber a dónde llevas\\r\neso?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "140_Taxi Driver"
msgid "Not yet... He said he'd call later to let me know."
msgstr "Aún no lo sé. Comentó que se pondría en contacto conmigo más tarde."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "152_Taxi Driver"
msgid "That said, I'd better get going... Well, so long."
msgstr "Así que, es mejor que me vaya... Cuídense."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "188_Nishihama"
msgid "Hello!? Yes, this is Nishihama!"
msgstr "¡¿Hola?! Sí, ¡habla Nishihama!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "200_Nishihama"
msgid "(It's the kidnapper.)"
msgstr "(¡Es el secuestrador!)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "212_Nishihama"
msgid "Yes... I gave it to the taxi driver. Now, where's my\\r\ndaughter!? Where's Miki!?"
msgstr "Sí... Se lo entregué al conductor del taxi, ¡¿dónde está\\r\nmi hija?! ¡¿Cómo se encuentra Miki?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "224_Nishihama"
msgid "...Huh!? The bathroom in West Park?"
msgstr "¿Cómo? ¡¿El baño en el parque oeste?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "236_Nishihama"
msgid "Hey! Wait a second! Don't hang up! Heeey!"
msgstr "¡Ah ¡Un momento! ¡No cuelgue, por favor! ¡¿Hola?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "260_Nishihama"
msgid "He said she's in the bathroom at West Park..."
msgstr "Dijo que se encuentra en el baño del parque oeste..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "308_Nishihama"
msgid "Miki!"
msgstr "¡Miki!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "392_Nishihama"
msgid "Miki, are you all right? Did he... Did he do anything to you?"
msgstr "Miki, ¡¿te encuentras bien?! ¡¿Él te... te hizo algo?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "404_Miki"
msgid "No, I'm fine... Thanks, Dad."
msgstr "Estoy bien, papá... Gracias."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "416_Nishihama"
msgid "Oh, thank goodness... Thank goodness you're okay."
msgstr "Oh, qué alivio... ¡Qué bueno que estés bien!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "428_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "440_Miki"
msgid "Um... Dad? Who's this?"
msgstr "Ehm... ¿Papá? ¿Quién es él?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "452_Nishihama"
msgid "This is Akiyama-san. He lent me some money, and, well, you\\r\nmight say he saved your life! You'd do well to thank him."
msgstr "Te presento a Akiyama-san. Él me prestó dinero y podría decirse\nque salvó tu vida. ¡Todo es gracias a él!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "476_Miki"
msgid "Um... Thank you very much for saving me, Akiyama-san."
msgstr "Ehm... Le agradezco mucho su ayuda, Akiyama-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "488_Akiyama"
msgid "Uh... Sure. Now, about your repayment date..."
msgstr "Eh... No hay de qué. Ahora, acerca del plazo de devolución..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "500_Nishihama"
msgid "Well, the thing is, I gave nearly all I had to the\\r\nkidnapper... Along with the money you gave me, that is."
msgstr "La verdad es que cedí casi todos mis fondos al\nsecuestrador... Más el dinero que usted me dio."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "512_Nishihama"
msgid "If you want me to pay you back right away, it's going to be\\r\nquite the challenge... Though there's no interest on that\\r\nloan, right?"
msgstr "Si quiere que le pague de inmediato, será bastante\ncomplicado... Aunque no hay interés en ese préstamo,\n¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "524_Akiyama"
msgid "That was our agreement, yes. Could you please sign or stamp\\r\nthis promissory note?"
msgstr "Así es, eso fue lo que acordamos. ¿Puedes firmar o poner tu sello\nen este pagaré?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "536_Nishihama"
msgid "Oh... Sure... There, it's done."
msgstr "Ah... ¡Con gusto! Listo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "548_Akiyama"
msgid "Thank you kindly. Okay then, I need to get this back to\\r\nthe office."
msgstr "Muchas gracias. Bueno, necesito devolver esto a la oficina."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "560_Nishihama"
msgid "Thank you, Akiyama-san! I'll be sure to pay you back someday."
msgstr "¡Muchas gracias, Akiyama-san! ¡Prometo que le pagaremos algún día!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "596_Akiyama"
msgid "She seems awfully cheerful, given the circumstances...\\r\nOh, well. Guess I'll head on back."
msgstr "Parece bastante alegre, dadas las circunstancias... Bueno, supongo que volveré a la oficina."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "620_Akiyama"
msgid "(Oh, it's Hana-chan.)"
msgstr "(Ah, Hana-chan)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "656_Akiyama"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "¿Aló?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "668_Hana"
msgid "Hi, Chief. Is the girl okay?"
msgstr "Hola, jefe. ¿La chica se encuentra bien?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "680_Akiyama"
msgid "Better than okay. Girl was downright bubbly."
msgstr "Mejor que nunca. Estaba bastante contenta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "692_Hana"
msgid "Hmm... Odd for someone who'd just been kidnapped."
msgstr "Mmm... Extraño para alguien que acaba de ser víctima de un secuestro."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "704_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. There's definitely something fishy going on."
msgstr "Exacto. No tengo dudas, hay algo que no cuadra."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "716_Akiyama"
msgid "I mean, putting the hostage in a bathroom before the deal\\r\ngoes through? What if Nishihama never handed over the\\r\nransom? Things like that."
msgstr "¿No es raro encerrar a la rehén en un baño antes de que el trato finalice? ¿Y si Nishihama nunca hubiera entregado el dinero?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "728_Hana"
msgid "It's a strange one, all right. Do you think he might've been\\r\npulling a fast one on you?"
msgstr "Esto es extraño. ¿Y si le tendieron una trampa?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "740_Akiyama"
msgid "Maybe... Either way, I'm gonna get to the bottom of it."
msgstr "Tal vez... Sea como sea, voy a averiguar qué está pasando."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "752_Hana"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "¿Eh...?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "764_Akiyama"
msgid "The family came together to work this scam. What would drive\\r\npeople to those lengths?"
msgstr "Un padre y su hija poniéndose de acuerdo para llevar a cabo un\nfraude. ¿Los seres humanos son capaces de llegar tan lejos?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "776_Hana"
msgid "*sigh* There's that bad habit of yours, Chief."
msgstr "*suspira* Ahí va esa mala costumbre otra vez, jefe."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "788_Akiyama"
msgid "What's the harm? I'm just going to poke around a little."
msgstr "¿Cuál es el problema? Solo voy a husmear un poco."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "800_Hana"
msgid "Let me give you some data, then. I'm looking through the cab\\r\ncompany's trip records now..."
msgstr "Permítame proporcionarle algunos datos. Ahora mismo estoy\nrevisando los registros de la compañía de taxis..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "812_Hana"
msgid "Here we go. Yep, this is fishy, all right."
msgstr "Veamos... Sí, esto definitivamente es raro."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "824_Hana"
msgid "The taxi that picked up the ransom money..."
msgstr "El taxi que se hizo cargo del dinero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "836_Hana"
msgid "It looks like it did a circuit of Kamurocho then stopped\\r\nnear Children's Park on Shichifuku."
msgstr "Hizo un recorrido por Kamurocho y luego se detuvo cerca\ndel parque infantil en Shichifuku."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "848_Akiyama"
msgid "Wow, Hana-chan... You looked all that up for me?"
msgstr "Increíble, Hana-chan... ¿Has averiguado todo esto por mí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "860_Hana"
msgid "I was kind of curious myself. Besides, I don't much care for\\r\ntricking people or seeing them get tricked."
msgstr "Tenía algo de curiosidad. Además, no me gusta engañar\na las personas ni ver cómo son engañadas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "872_Akiyama"
msgid "That sounds like you, all right. Children's Park on\\r\nShichifuku Street, huh? All right, I'll go take a look."
msgstr "Típico de ti. ¿El parque infantil en Shichifuku? Está bien, iré a dar una vuelta."

